lor":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-05-12T16:26:39Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T10:37:12Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.4.1 and 4.3\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11, Intel Arc integrated graphics, Rendering backend: OpenGL\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn Godot 4.4.1.stable (official build), there's a noticeable delay when running a scene or project using the Compatibility renderer. It takes about 4 seconds to start, whereas the same scene starts in under 0.5 seconds with Forward+ or Mobile mode.\n\nI also tested this on Godot 4.3.stable and observed the same issue, so it does not appear to be a recent regression introduced in 4.4.\n\nThis issue appears even with minimal scenes (e.g., Node2D with a Sprite2D and no scripts or plugins).\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1.  Create a new Godot project in 4.4.1.stable\n    \n2.  Create a minimal scene with a Node2D and Sprite2D\n    \n3.  In Project Settings → Rendering → Renderer, switch between Compatibility, Forward+, and Mobile\n    \n4.  Run the scene (F6) or full project (F5)\n    \n5.  Observe the difference in startup time\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106310/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106310/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}